when I was little.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Vous avez obtenu votre diplôme quand ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">When did you get your degree?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>J'ai obtenu mon diplôme en 2020.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I got my degree in 2020.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Et maintenant, qu'est-ce que vous voulez faire ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And now, what do you want to do?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Je voudrais faire un master, puis un doctorat.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'd like to do a master's, then a doctorate.</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276056,"_nanoseconds":880000000}},{"id":"5nsr06aKx8ZibwrLpV7l","level":"a2","lesson":17,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"a2-l17-p08-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Qu'est-ce que vous avez étudié ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What did you study?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">J'ai étudié le français à l'université.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I studied French at university.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"J'ai étudié le français à l'université.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276056,"_nanoseconds":889000000}},{"id":"lN8fwB7uQnJsNF78CeDW","level":"a2","lesson":17,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"a2-l17-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 2/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Pourquoi avez-vous choisi cette matière ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Why did you choose that subject?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Parce que j'adorais les langues quand j'étais petit.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Because I loved languages when I was little.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Parce que j'adorais les langues quand j'étais petit.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276056,"_nanoseconds":891000000}},{"id":"YTjckIMuUqI4fIrOrrzH","level":"a2","lesson":17,"part":10,"type":"text","name":"a2-l17-p10-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 3/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Vous avez obtenu votre diplôme quand ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">When did you get your degree?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">J'ai obtenu mon diplôme en 2020.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I got my degree in 2020.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"J'ai obtenu mon diplôme en 2020.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276057,"_nanoseconds":163000000}},{"id":"TiuJm4qN8xdLNDCsCU71","level":"a2","lesson":17,"part":11,"type":"text","name":"a2-l17-p11-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 4/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Et maintenant, qu'est-ce que vous voulez faire ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And now, what do you want to do?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Je voudrais faire un master, puis un doctorat.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'd like to do a master's, then a doctorate.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Je voudrais faire un master, puis un doctorat.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276057,"_nanoseconds":296000000}},{"id":"MTnCWiWeyFyndQnaqhIZ","level":"a2","lesson":17,"part":12,"type":"text","name":"a2-l17-p12-b1","partTitle":"Speak freely","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.4rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Parlez de vos études.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0 0 10px;\">Talk about your studies.</p><p><b>Say what you studied, why, and what you plan next.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.7;\">For example: “J'ai étudié le français. J'ai choisi cette matière parce que j'adorais les langues. Je voudrais faire un master.”</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Now it's your turn to speak!","expectedText":"J'ai étudié le français. J'ai choisi cette matière parce que j'adorais les langues. Je voudrais faire un master.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276057,"_nanoseconds":291000000}},{"id":"UG6mXQxMDm00lKwaXJLm","level":"a2","lesson":17,"part":13,"type":"text","name":"a2-l17-p13-b1","partTitle":"Well done","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:64px;line-height:1.1;\">🎓</div><p><b>Study story told!</b></p></div><p style=\"line-height:1.6;\">🧑‍🏫 You can talk about your studies from past to future. A complete mini life story.</p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276057,"_nanoseconds":342000000}}]